Warcraft III voice lines (Czech dub)

The audio files in this folder are excerpts of voice recordings from the Czech dub of
Warcraft III, (c) Blizzard Entertainment. They were extracted from the YouTube playlist
https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLQNF-ZjhDFeDZaqd5qCr6dE60e1XXgNnP
(vocal separation with Demucs, transcription with Whisper, segmentation and loudness polish).

This is third-party game content, included in this repository at the repository owner's
